rocprofiler-register embeds fmt 11.1.4 and glog 0.7.1. HSA embeds the
ROCT thunk and its Nginx-derived rbtree. HRX/Loom include IREE and the
CORE-MATH adaptation. Zstandard includes xxHash by Yann Collet / Meta.
Compiler tables use AMD GPU ISA XML (MIT); compiler/runtime builds also
use HSA, SPIR-V and Vulkan headers. Their source licenses are included.

HRX/Loom are modified by the seven patches distributed with the source.
AMD modifies sysdeps library names and symbol versions; its complete build
recipes and patch scripts are in the accompanying TheRock source archive.
No further changes are made to the AMD library bytes.

libelf is distributed under LGPL-3.0-or-later; libnuma under LGPL-2.1-only.
Corresponding source, modification/build scripts, and all license texts are
available alongside the binary archive at no charge:
